SportSplits Tracker provides real-time tracking and other services for world-class events.

Sportsplits is a global sports timing and results provider for thousands of events in 5 regions of the world:
 
AFRICA
ASIA
EUROPE
OCEANIA
MIDDLE EAST
 
App Highlights:

• Participant times, paces, estimates, and places in real-time; 
• Interactive Course Map & Live Map Tracking;
• Easy tracking of multiple participants at the same time;
• Push Notifications as progress is made on course;
• Event Info and Messaging;
• Live Leaderboards;
• Social Sharing & Notifications;
• Remote Racing (at some events).


PLEASE NOTE: Not all SportSplits events are available in the SportSplits Tracker app. Some included events may not use all features. 
Established in 1990 as an Australian timing and results company. In 2006 the company went Global as SportSplits.

Fishing Organiser is a fishing app. Not a social media platform, not a place to brag but a private fishing app to log all your fishing trips in all their details.

Features:
- Trips: detailed with precise GPS location, date/time, duration, fishing style, notes, photo, automated astronomical observations and historical weather data;
- Associated captures: single or multiple type, detailed by species, coordinates, length/count, weight, photo and more;
- Solunar: use these tables to get help finding the most favorable fish feeding periods by Sun and Moon positions and phases. No worries: unlimited lookahead and lookbehind;
- Weather: 48 hour hourly forecast and 7 day general forecast, based on your location and updated every hour;
- Encyclopedia: all the worlds fish species, groupped by country/zone and displayed in the language of yoor choice;
- Encyclopedia is an Open Project: add common names, propose new fish species and associate existing ones with countries/zones;
- Statistics and graphics;
- Fished locations map and list;
- Compass: have you forgotten the exact location of a previous fishing trip or capture ? Let the app show you the direction and distance with this simple and intuitive feature;
- In-app feedback system: let us know what you think and read other fishermen impressum;
- Voting system: as the Encyclopedia and the Feedback sections are shared within all the client apps, have the possibility to express your opinion by voting;
- Cloud Data Protection: all fishing trips informations are backed up in Cloud, secure. Have no worries if your device ever breaks, gets lost or similar. Your data is secured;
- Sync accross: having multiple devices ? Got to your fishing spot with a different device ? No worries! Install the app on any other compatible, login with your user and start/continue entering informations. We'll sync all of your informations accross all of your devices; solved;
- Photos: enrich every fishing trip memory by attaching photos. Have no worries about device storage space; all photos are stored in cloud, no weight on your devices storage capacity. You're also in control of your mobile data usage: choose to download/display them on Wi-Fi only or mobile data also, your choice;
- More, in this app;


These being said, we hope you'll have a good experience with this fishing app and, if you'll consider, allow it to be your fishing history keeper!
